# Emitted by tauri-build from `tauri.conf.json` and the capability files
# on every build; regenerating it is part of the build, not of review.
gen/

# Emitted by the `build.rs` that declares a command list, which lands
# with the command surface itself. Nothing here produces them, but a
# build of a later commit in the same working tree leaves them behind,
# and an untracked build artifact is one `git add -A` away from being
# committed to the wrong commit — which is how they arrived here the
# first time.
permissions/autogenerated/
